notes = "Actual MuddySurface is mechanically reachable but inherits AreaCondition.has_visible_presence=false, so current get_spatial_observation supplies no visible spatial owner/cells. This ledger selects no extra ground artwork without an actual disclosed owner. Actual recipient conditions, movement and damage retain their existing presentation. This is an explicit current disclosure/presentation decision, not a missing body asset or an invented public footprint."
